Conjures up a spear of bones, doing [153, 205, 246, 281, 312 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage to all targets in a line.  Each target takes an additional 20% damage for each magical debuff they are afflicted with up to a max of 100% ([305, 410, 492, 562, 623 (TL1-5; SP 100)]).

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
